1
00:00:09,215 --> 00:00:12,395
It's twenty twenty-one, the year is here,
今年是二零二一年，這一年來到，

2
00:00:12,395 --> 00:00:15,985
Back in junior high, thirty-three classmates near.
想起國中時，身邊有三十三名同學。

3
00:00:16,255 --> 00:00:18,455
This year I turn thirty-three,
今年我滿三十三歲，

4
00:00:18,455 --> 00:00:21,695
Which classes match? Let's go and see!
哪些班級也一樣？一起去看看！

5
00:00:21,695 --> 00:00:24,075
Class Two? Not sure, maybe not,
二班？不確定，也許不是，

6
00:00:24,075 --> 00:00:27,075
Five, Twelve, Eighteen, Twenty-three got the spot!
五班、十二班、十八班、二十三班符合！

7
00:00:27,075 --> 00:00:28,875
Four classes, thirty-three each,
四個班，每班三十三人，

8
00:00:28,875 --> 00:00:30,975
Math teacher's lesson, back in reach!
數學老師的課，又回到記憶裡！

9
00:00:30,975 --> 00:00:34,395
Four numbers, choose just two,
四個數字，只選兩個，

10
00:00:34,395 --> 00:00:37,995
Six combinations coming through!
六種組合就出現！

11
00:00:37,995 --> 00:00:41,195
Five and Twelve, Five and Eighteen,
五和十二，五和十八，

12
00:00:41,195 --> 00:00:44,855
Five and Twenty-three on the scene.
五和二十三也登場。

13
00:00:44,855 --> 00:00:48,335
Twelve and Eighteen, Twelve and Twenty-three,
十二和十八，十二和二十三，

14
00:00:48,335 --> 00:00:52,335
Eighteen and Twenty-three, that's all six!
十八和二十三，六種全到齊！

15
00:00:52,335 --> 00:00:55,815
Seems meaningless, what can it be?
好像沒意義，究竟是什麼？

16
00:00:55,815 --> 00:00:59,895
My junior high yearbook calling me?
是國中畢業紀念冊在呼喚我？

17
00:00:59,895 --> 00:01:02,485
"Feng Bro! Feng Bro!" Who's calling my name?
「鋒兄！鋒兄！」誰在叫我的名字？

18
00:01:03,575 --> 00:01:07,065
Am I hearing things? Is this some game?
我是不是幻聽？這是什麼遊戲？

19
00:01:07,375 --> 00:01:10,395
The graduation yearbook calls once more,
畢業紀念冊再度呼喚，

20
00:01:10,395 --> 00:01:14,715
"Feng Bro, I'll show you what these numbers are for!
「鋒兄，我來告訴你這些數字的意義！

21
00:01:14,715 --> 00:01:18,055
Make it happen, meaning comes alive,
做得到，意義就活起來，

22
00:01:18,055 --> 00:01:21,855
Fail to do it, meaning won't survive!"
做不到，意義就不存在！」

23
00:01:21,855 --> 00:01:24,155
"Meaning? How could there be meaning?"
「意義？怎麼可能有意義？」

24
00:01:24,155 --> 00:01:26,435
Five and Twelve, here's the deal,
五和十二，條件就在這裡，

25
00:01:26,435 --> 00:01:28,295
Top exam rank would make it real!
考到榜首，就讓意義成真！

26
00:01:28,295 --> 00:01:29,675
"No way, I'm not that smart!"
「不可能，我才沒那麼聰明！」

27
00:01:29,675 --> 00:01:31,495
"Then fifty points, just make a start!"
「那五十分呢？先開始吧！」

28
00:01:31,495 --> 00:01:34,395
"I'll give it a try, let's see my score!"
「我試試看，看看能考幾分！」

29
00:01:34,395 --> 00:01:37,815
Twenty twenty-two, forty-six, no more.
二零二二年，只有四十六分。

30
00:01:37,815 --> 00:01:39,015
"You're really bad!"
「你真的很差！」

31
00:01:39,015 --> 00:01:40,755
"I don't wanna test, I'm going mad!"
「我不想考試，都快瘋了！」

32
00:01:40,755 --> 00:01:42,555
Twenty twenty-five, fifty points came through,
二零二五年，五十分考到了，

33
00:01:42,555 --> 00:01:44,275
"Where's that promise? What happened to you?"
「說好的承諾呢？你怎麼了？」

34
00:01:44,275 --> 00:01:46,035
"I'm done with exams, I'm out of here!"
「考試到此為止，我不考了！」

35
00:01:46,035 --> 00:01:48,035
"Once you're past thirty-seven, no more exams to fear!"
「過了三十七歲，就不用再怕考試！」

36
00:01:48,035 --> 00:01:49,935
"That's great news, I feel so free!
「這消息真好，我感到自由！

37
00:01:49,935 --> 00:01:51,835
Never liked exams, that's always been me!"
我本來就不喜歡考試！」

38
00:01:51,835 --> 00:01:53,735
"Wait a minute, I ranked number one!
「等等，我考到第一名了！

39
00:01:53,735 --> 00:01:55,215
I really did it, the race is won!"
我真的做到了，贏下這場考試！」

40
00:01:55,215 --> 00:01:58,335
If Five means grade five, Twelve means grade twelve,
如果五是五職等，十二是十二職等，

41
00:01:58,335 --> 00:02:01,805
Does fifty-two mean age fifty-two as well?
五十二也代表五十二歲嗎？

42
00:02:02,035 --> 00:02:04,125
"Yes and no."
「是，也不是。」

43
00:02:04,375 --> 00:02:06,075
"What does that mean? I need to know!"
「這是什麼意思？我想知道！」

44
00:02:06,075 --> 00:02:07,935
"If you're fifty-two and not grade twelve,
「如果到了五十二歲，還不是十二職等，

45
00:02:07,935 --> 00:02:09,715
That combination ends itself."
這組就到此結束。」

46
00:02:09,715 --> 00:02:12,835
"But grade twelve means Deputy Secretary-General,
「但十二職等是副秘書長，

47
00:02:12,835 --> 00:02:16,435
And not at fifty-two — that's the scenario!"
而且不是五十二歲——就是這樣！」

48
00:02:16,435 --> 00:02:19,955
"Look again, there are more pairs to see!"
「再看看，還有其他組合！」

49
00:02:19,955 --> 00:02:23,975
"You're right, more combinations waiting for me!"
「你說得對，還有更多組合等著我！」

50
00:02:23,975 --> 00:02:27,155
Five and Eighteen, nothing to say,
五和十八，沒什麼好說，

51
00:02:27,155 --> 00:02:30,515
No meaning here, let's skip away!
這組沒意義，直接跳過！

52
00:02:30,515 --> 00:02:33,525
Five and Twenty-three, what could it be?
五和二十三，會是什麼呢？

53
00:02:33,815 --> 00:02:35,555
Class Five, student Twenty-three?
五班，二十三號同學？

54
00:02:35,555 --> 00:02:38,615
A classmate from junior high cram school?
國中補習班的同學？

55
00:02:38,615 --> 00:02:41,505
What's so special? What's the rule?
有什麼特別？有什麼道理？

56
00:02:42,235 --> 00:02:42,965
"What do you think?"
「你覺得呢？」

57
00:02:43,595 --> 00:02:45,645
"Is she a civil servant, do you think?"
「你覺得她是公務人員嗎？」

58
00:02:45,875 --> 00:02:47,035
"Not a permanent one!"
「不是正式的！」

59
00:02:47,035 --> 00:02:48,415
"So she's on contract, then?"
「那就是約聘人員？」

60
00:02:48,415 --> 00:02:52,835
"You'll know someday, just wait and see,
「總有一天你會知道，等著看，

61
00:02:52,835 --> 00:02:56,465
So I won't tell you, let the mystery be!"
所以我不告訴你，保留這個謎！」

62
00:02:56,955 --> 00:02:59,795
Twelve and Eighteen, here comes the show,
十二和十八，好戲登場，

63
00:02:59,795 --> 00:03:03,825
A Ziwei sage runs for Taipei mayor — whoa!
有個紫微聖人參選台北市長——哇！

64
00:03:04,015 --> 00:03:06,525
"That's interesting, what a surprise!
「真有趣，多麼意外！

65
00:03:07,035 --> 00:03:11,055
Twenty twenty-two, look at the numbers rise!"
看看二零二二年的數字！」

66
00:03:11,055 --> 00:03:14,335
Eighth mayoral term, fourteenth council term,
第八屆市長，第十四屆議會，

67
00:03:14,335 --> 00:03:18,255
Four terms ahead, the numbers align!
往後四屆，數字就對上了！

68
00:03:18,255 --> 00:03:20,895
Other counties? Let's take a look,
其他縣市呢？一起看看，

69
00:03:20,895 --> 00:03:22,725
Kinmen's eighth, council eighth in the book.
金門第八屆，議會也是第八屆。

70
00:03:23,035 --> 00:03:24,515
Lienchiang's eighth, council eighth as well,
連江第八屆，議會也同樣第八屆，

71
00:03:24,515 --> 00:03:26,335
No more matches that I can tell!
看來沒有其他符合的了！

72
00:03:26,335 --> 00:03:28,505
"Mayor of Taipei? You're joking, right?
「台北市長？你在開玩笑吧？

73
00:03:28,895 --> 00:03:31,675
I'd rather be mayor before Huang Ta-chou's time,
要當也要當黃大洲之前的市長，

74
00:03:31,675 --> 00:03:33,615
With presidential backing on my side!"
有總統在身邊支持！」

75
00:03:33,615 --> 00:03:36,575
Twelve and Twenty-three, nothing to say,
十二和二十三，沒什麼好說，

76
00:03:36,575 --> 00:03:39,635
No meaning here, let's skip away!
這組沒意義，直接跳過！

77
00:03:39,635 --> 00:03:42,675
Eighteen and Twenty-three, one last pair,
十八和二十三，最後一組，

78
00:03:42,675 --> 00:03:47,415
Twenty twenty-four, the numbers are there!
二零二四年，數字就在這裡！

79
00:03:47,415 --> 00:03:50,055
Sixteenth president and vice president,
第十六任總統與副總統，

80
00:03:50,055 --> 00:03:52,075
Eleventh Legislative Yuan in line.
第十一屆立法院。

81
00:03:52,075 --> 00:03:53,975
Seven terms ahead, they coincide,
往後七屆，數字就重合，

82
00:03:53,975 --> 00:03:56,035
Another pattern side by side!
又是一組並列的規律！

83
00:03:56,035 --> 00:03:59,315
"President? That sounds pretty normal to me,
「總統？我聽起來很正常，

84
00:03:59,315 --> 00:04:01,535
Taipei mayor, then presidency."
台北市長，接著當總統。」

85
00:04:01,535 --> 00:04:06,005
"But why become president at all?
「但為什麼一定要當總統？

86
00:04:06,475 --> 00:04:09,295
Does it have to do with history's call?"
這與歷史的召喚有關嗎？」

87
00:04:09,295 --> 00:04:13,745
"If history has nothing to do with me,
「如果歷史與我無關，

88
00:04:13,995 --> 00:04:16,925
Why must I take that destiny?"
為什麼非得接受那個命運？」

89
00:04:17,275 --> 00:04:20,765
Six combinations, one conversation,
六種組合，一場對話，

90
00:04:21,255 --> 00:04:24,035
Numbers and dreams, imagination!
數字、夢想與想像！

91
00:04:24,035 --> 00:04:27,825
This is the dialogue of combination,
這就是排列組合的對話，

92
00:04:28,235 --> 00:04:31,445
A yearbook's mysterious conversation!
一場畢業紀念冊的神祕交談！
